---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: db.sources
  size: 1
  alias: source
permalink: "/sources/{{ source.id }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ source.title }}"
---
{% from "macros.njk" import listCard %}
<div class="wrap section">
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="crumbs"><a href="/sources/">Sources</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span aria-current="page">{{ source.title }}</span></nav>
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ source.type or "Source" }}</p>
  <h1><i>{{ source.title }}</i></h1>
  {% if source.title_original %}<p class="orig" dir="auto">{{ source.title_original }}</p>{% endif %}
  <p class="sub">{% if source.place %}<a href="{{ source.place.url }}">{{ source.place.name }}</a>{% endif %}{% if source.publisher %} · {{ source.publisher }}{% endif %}{% if source.dates %} · {{ source.dates }}{% endif %}{% if source.catalogueUrl %} · <a href="{{ source.catalogueUrl }}">Catalogue / digitized copy</a>{% endif %}</p>
  {% if source.notes %}<p>{{ source.notes }}</p>{% endif %}
  {% if source.id == "bdai-box1-folder01" or source.id == "hboas-report-1874-bound-bdai" %}
  <section class="section-tight" aria-label="Bound volume review and exports">
    <p>All 492 scans have been screened for named lists. The volume yielded 73 lists and 1,388 source appearances, including the inserted asylum report. List transcriptions remain drafts pending independent proofreading.</p>
    <p><a href="/assets/reviews/bdai-box1-folder01/full-volume-entries.csv" download>Download all volume entries (CSV)</a> · <a href="/assets/reviews/bdai-box1-folder01/list-inventory.csv" download>List inventory (CSV)</a> · <a href="/assets/reviews/bdai-box1-folder01/page-review.tsv" download>Scan-by-scan review (TSV)</a> · <a href="/assets/reviews/bdai-box1-folder01/financial-context.csv" download>Financial context (CSV)</a></p>
    {% if source.id == "bdai-box1-folder01" %}<p>The inserted <a href="/sources/hboas-report-1874-bound-bdai/">1874 Hebrew Benevolent and Orphan Asylum Society report</a> has its own source record and lists.</p>{% else %}<p>This publication is bound within the <a href="/sources/bdai-box1-folder01/">Board of Delegates volume</a>. The CSV above includes both sources.</p>{% endif %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}
  {% for r in mikvehCollection.records %}{% if r.source_id == source.id %}
  <p><a href="/collections/mikveh-israel/">Mikveh Israel collection review</a> · {{ r.scans }} supplied scans · {{ r.status }}. <a href="/assets/reviews/mikveh-israel/page-inventory.csv">Scan-by-scan review register</a></p>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  {% if sourceTables[source.id] %}
  {% set dataset = sourceTables[source.id] %}
  <section class="section-tight">
    <h2>Statistical tables</h2>
    <p>{{ dataset.scope }}</p>
    {% if dataset.images and dataset.images.length %}<div class="page-thumbs" style="display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      {% for img in dataset.images %}<a href="{{ img }}"><img src="{{ img }}" alt="PDF page {{ loop.index }} of {{ source.title }}" loading="lazy" style="width:150px;height:auto;"></a>{% endfor %}
    </div>{% endif %}
    <p class="muted small-note">{{ dataset.image_credit or "Source images: JDC Archives, record 2573854. Select a page to view it full size." }}</p>
    {% if dataset.tables.length > 6 %}<nav aria-label="Tables"><p>{% for table in dataset.tables %}<a href="#{{ table.id }}">{{ table.title }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p></nav>{% endif %}
    {% for table in dataset.tables %}
      <section class="section-tight" id="{{ table.id }}">
        <h3>{{ table.title }}</h3>
        <p>Reference period: {{ table.as_of }} · {{ table.page_label or "PDF p." }} {{ table.page }} · <a href="{{ table.csv_url }}" download>Download table as CSV</a></p>
        <p>{{ table.notes }}</p>
        <div class="table-box"><table>
          <thead><tr>{% for heading in table.headers %}<th scope="col">{{ heading }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr></thead>
          <tbody>{% for row in table.rows %}<tr>{% for cell in row %}{% if loop.first %}<th scope="row">{{ cell }}</th>{% else %}<td>{{ cell }}</td>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tr>{% endfor %}</tbody>
        </table></div>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}
  <section class="section-tight">
    <h2>Lists in this source</h2>
    {% if source.lists.length %}<div class="grid-3">{% for l in source.lists %}{{ listCard(l) }}{% endfor %}</div>{% elif sourceTables[source.id] %}<p>This source contains statistical tables, shown above. Its countries and age groups are not indexed as people.</p>{% else %}<p>No lists have been transcribed from this source yet.</p>{% endif %}
  </section>
</div>
